{"id":"658233","name":"炒米粉","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658233/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米粉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"1小把"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"米粉、白菜、鸡蛋、韭菜。","img":"images/658233/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"米粉加入酱油上色，鸡蛋加盐调成液，白菜切丝，韭菜切段。","img":"images/658233/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅热油，鸡蛋入锅煎。","img":"images/658233/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煎成块，装碗备用。","img":"images/658233/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"接着把白菜炒软。","img":"images/658233/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入米粉翻炒。","img":"images/658233/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入鸡蛋。","img":"images/658233/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入韭菜。","img":"images/658233/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后放入胡椒粉，翻炒入味出锅。","img":"images/658233/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658233/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}